WEBVTT

00:19.360 --> 00:21.160
This is India's best watch,

00:21.800 --> 00:22.800
not the world's.

00:25.560 --> 00:27.120
There's still a long way to go.

01:12.360 --> 01:13.520
It's been so many years,

01:13.840 --> 01:16.120
yet you still haven't stopped
drinking watermelon juice.

01:16.920 --> 01:19.600
Certain things need to be constant.

01:22.480 --> 01:26.120
- So, Mr. 'Xerox' Desai.
- Hmm.

01:26.680 --> 01:28.320
I've learnt that your company

01:28.400 --> 01:30.600
has almost put an end
to watch smuggling.

01:31.080 --> 01:33.000
And, Mr. Dikshit, I've heard

01:33.040 --> 01:36.240
that several watch brands,
inspired by your idea,

01:36.520 --> 01:39.280
have opened their own stores
in Zaveri Bazaar.

01:41.760 --> 01:42.560
What?

01:42.600 --> 01:44.840
Praising me doesn't suit you.

01:45.080 --> 01:46.240
Please don't do it.

01:46.440 --> 01:47.240
Okay.

01:47.280 --> 01:49.120
I have something more
than just praise for you.

01:50.280 --> 01:51.240
- For me?
- Hmm.

01:51.480 --> 01:52.800
Let me see.

02:06.720 --> 02:09.000
Six months' paid leave?

02:18.760 --> 02:22.120
Should I consider this
a friend's favour or a boss's gift?

02:22.400 --> 02:24.840
Consider it an order
from Titan's MD.

02:25.200 --> 02:26.800
Now take a deep breath

02:26.840 --> 02:28.760
and enjoy your vacation.

02:29.360 --> 02:30.520
You deserve it.

02:31.360 --> 02:33.680
Where did this sudden
understanding come from?

02:34.840 --> 02:36.160
What understanding?

02:37.280 --> 02:39.680
[in Marathi] I'm bored
of seeing your face every day.

02:40.840 --> 02:42.920
[in Gujarati] The boy has gone mad.

02:44.480 --> 02:45.520
No, genuinely.

02:45.560 --> 02:48.000
I'm bored of seeing your face.

02:48.520 --> 02:50.080
Just think about Vihaan.

02:50.200 --> 02:51.760
Vihaan's college,

02:51.840 --> 02:54.280
your eighty-five-year-old father,
and Kumud.

02:54.760 --> 02:55.840
Kumud!

02:56.400 --> 02:58.520
Go and bore them.

02:58.680 --> 02:59.560
Please go.

03:02.720 --> 03:03.720
Fair enough.

03:06.120 --> 03:09.640
But remember,
if my salary is even a month late,

03:10.160 --> 03:12.520
I shall come straight to your house
to collect my pay cheque.

03:13.040 --> 03:13.840
Understood?

03:13.920 --> 03:15.000
Yes, I understand.

03:16.440 --> 03:17.800
Now pay for the juice.

03:23.600 --> 03:24.720
- Oi.
- Hmm?

03:27.680 --> 03:28.520
Thank you.

03:53.680 --> 03:55.360
- Europe?
- Yes.

03:57.600 --> 03:59.240
So, you're going global?

03:59.440 --> 04:00.240
Hmm.

04:00.320 --> 04:02.120
Since when have you
been obsessed with it?

04:02.480 --> 04:04.000
It's not an obsession, Jeh.

04:04.480 --> 04:06.760
If we don't go global now,

04:07.040 --> 04:09.120
Titan will become history.

04:09.560 --> 04:12.240
I don't want us
to be limited like GMT.

04:12.520 --> 04:15.000
Zee, I think you're being
over-ambitious.

04:16.680 --> 04:19.480
You're already doing
so well in India.

04:22.240 --> 04:23.200
Anyway.

04:25.280 --> 04:27.160
What does Gopalan
have to say about this?

04:27.200 --> 04:28.400
He thinks the same.

04:30.160 --> 04:31.280
Great!

04:32.520 --> 04:36.160
Then I suppose Akash

04:37.160 --> 04:38.440
- must be on your side too.
- Actually...

04:38.520 --> 04:42.440
I don't want to stress him
about this deal.

04:42.560 --> 04:44.120
- Why?
- He has taken a vacation

04:44.240 --> 04:46.040
for the first time
in the past fifteen years.

04:46.560 --> 04:48.880
I want him to enjoy
some uninterrupted family time.

04:51.760 --> 04:53.320
So,

04:54.080 --> 04:55.280
why only Europe?

04:56.440 --> 04:58.240
You can go anywhere in the world.

04:59.120 --> 05:01.680
Expand in Asia

05:01.920 --> 05:03.680
or head to the US.

05:03.760 --> 05:05.120
Yes... Right.

05:05.200 --> 05:07.320
But if Titan creates its demand

05:07.400 --> 05:09.560
in Europe,

05:10.120 --> 05:11.800
especially in the Swiss market,

05:11.880 --> 05:14.040
the whole world will have to admit

05:14.240 --> 05:17.480
that Indians can make
world-class watches,

05:17.600 --> 05:19.760
including Andre Jeuba.

05:22.680 --> 05:23.640
Oh!

05:23.920 --> 05:26.480
Well, it's your company,

05:27.320 --> 05:28.840
so you must make the decision.

05:30.120 --> 05:33.240
In any case,
I'm considering retirement.

05:34.600 --> 05:35.600
- What?
- Oh, come on!

05:35.680 --> 05:37.480
Don't pretend as if
you didn't see it coming.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.640
It's time.

05:39.960 --> 05:43.080
It's time for me to stop.

05:53.400 --> 05:55.320
Mr... Uh...

05:56.280 --> 05:57.760
- Xerxes.
- "Xerxes."

05:57.800 --> 05:59.520
Xerxes. That's right.

06:00.120 --> 06:02.800
We are one of the most
reputed distributors

06:02.800 --> 06:04.280
of luxury watches.

06:05.040 --> 06:06.680
We want you to succeed,

06:06.880 --> 06:09.600
and we also want you
to invest wisely

06:09.720 --> 06:12.000
in this competitive market.

06:12.800 --> 06:16.920
For 1,500 premium
stores across Europe,

06:17.440 --> 06:20.120
I have a pretty good offer for you.

06:21.080 --> 06:22.040
Which is?

06:23.320 --> 06:24.400
Fifty crores?

06:24.960 --> 06:25.760
Yes.

06:25.880 --> 06:27.920
You want to invest more in Europe

06:28.520 --> 06:30.440
than the profit we make in India,
Desai?

06:30.680 --> 06:32.560
Sir, in such a competitive market,

06:33.720 --> 06:35.760
we won't get a better deal.

06:36.840 --> 06:39.160
Gopalan, what's your take on this?

06:40.160 --> 06:43.600
Mr. Desai works
according to his convictions,

06:43.680 --> 06:44.640
and

06:45.520 --> 06:49.120
so far, it has served us well, sir.

06:50.240 --> 06:52.200
Sir, Winston Churchill once said,

06:52.800 --> 06:54.560
"One man's conviction

06:55.080 --> 06:58.040
can outweigh hundreds of opinions."

06:59.120 --> 07:02.200
You’re the one who brought
Titan this far, against all odds.

07:04.280 --> 07:06.240
So let us go ahead with it.

07:07.720 --> 07:08.680
Let's go ahead.

07:09.640 --> 07:11.720
But if it doesn't work,

07:11.960 --> 07:14.600
Titan will suffer a massive loss.

07:16.680 --> 07:19.360
And the company won't
be able to bear that burden.

07:20.120 --> 07:21.600
I completely understand, sir.

07:22.280 --> 07:23.200
All the best.

07:24.800 --> 07:25.600
Thank you.

07:46.800 --> 07:47.920
Everyone!

07:48.680 --> 07:49.800
We have good news.

07:49.880 --> 07:51.480
We're entering the European market.

07:51.560 --> 07:52.400
We've engaged

07:52.440 --> 07:56.120
with one of the largest European
companies for distribution,

07:56.640 --> 07:59.640
called Timeless Voyage.

08:03.160 --> 08:05.000
Akash must be very happy.

08:05.320 --> 08:07.920
Well, we haven't told him yet.

08:08.080 --> 08:11.760
And I do not want
any of you to tell him.

08:12.360 --> 08:15.000
I want him to enjoy
a stress-free vacation,

08:15.040 --> 08:16.960
and this would
only cause him stress.

08:18.560 --> 08:19.840
Oh! Also, both of you

08:19.880 --> 08:22.080
should shortlist
the designs with Ravindra.

08:22.080 --> 08:24.560
Gopalan and I
will make the final selection.

08:24.800 --> 08:25.600
Okay, sir.

08:25.760 --> 08:27.400
How many designs do you need?

08:27.880 --> 08:30.680
Well, finally, ten.

08:31.120 --> 08:33.520
Sir, how many watches
are we sending?

08:35.320 --> 08:36.600
At least 20,000.

08:58.120 --> 09:00.880
'Well played, Sachin Tendulkar!'

09:04.360 --> 09:06.560
Vihaan, everyone will be there.
Do come with us.

09:06.840 --> 09:09.000
There's an important match
going on, Dad.

09:09.320 --> 09:10.480
I'm not coming.

09:10.840 --> 09:14.000
When will Gavaskar take the strike?

09:15.200 --> 09:17.120
It will come later, Grandpa.

09:21.920 --> 09:23.920
Okay, but take care
of your grandfather.

09:23.960 --> 09:24.880
Okay, fine.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.360
Shall we?

09:27.720 --> 09:28.600
How do I look?

09:29.240 --> 09:30.040
Perfect.

09:30.440 --> 09:32.240
I'm going to meet them
after six months.

09:33.160 --> 09:34.840
It feels as though
I'm returning home.

09:35.320 --> 09:37.080
Even after being away
from me for so many years,

09:37.440 --> 09:38.640
you didn't miss me much.

09:38.800 --> 09:40.840
Yet, being away from Titan
for only six months

09:40.920 --> 09:42.000
has made you nostalgic.

09:44.440 --> 09:45.720
- Let's go, we could be late.
- Yes.

09:45.800 --> 09:46.600
Let's go.

09:46.640 --> 09:47.960
- Bye, Father-in-law! Bye, son!
- Bye, Dad!

09:48.000 --> 09:48.840
Bye!

09:51.000 --> 09:53.160
Sir, I heard you're leaving.

09:53.280 --> 09:54.640
Yes, you heard correctly.

09:55.000 --> 09:57.440
Titan is now running
smoothly on its own.

09:57.760 --> 09:59.640
Now it's time to find a new place

09:59.680 --> 10:01.160
to build a new brand.

10:02.960 --> 10:05.720
- But, sir, why so soon?
- It's not soon at all.

10:06.200 --> 10:08.560
Titan is in safe hands now.
It no longer needs me.

10:10.720 --> 10:12.160
I'll just get myself a drink.

10:14.040 --> 10:14.840
Good evening!

10:14.920 --> 10:16.200
- Good evening, sir.
- Evening!

10:16.440 --> 10:17.560
- Good evening, sir.
- Namaste.

10:18.040 --> 10:19.120
Awesome.

10:20.120 --> 10:21.320
Hello, ma'am.

10:21.560 --> 10:23.520
- Namaste.
- Namaste...

10:23.560 --> 10:24.440
Sorry!

10:26.040 --> 10:27.960
You've turned
my daughter's life around.

10:28.680 --> 10:29.480
Thank you very much.

10:29.600 --> 10:30.760
No. Thank you!

10:31.160 --> 10:32.680
Your daughter is truly bright.

10:32.720 --> 10:34.480
She's very special.

10:37.160 --> 10:38.240
I'll just be back.

10:38.360 --> 10:39.640
Two minutes. Enjoy the party.

10:39.920 --> 10:40.800
Let's go.

10:44.240 --> 10:47.040
- Zee!
- You've finally accepted your age.

10:47.920 --> 10:51.160
I'm still younger than you.

10:52.000 --> 10:55.040
Congratulations, sir,
on your illustrious career.

10:55.360 --> 10:57.320
You should say, "Good one, sir."

10:58.680 --> 11:00.000
Where's your second wife?

11:00.560 --> 11:01.480
- "Second?"
- "Second..."

11:01.800 --> 11:02.840
No... I...

11:02.880 --> 11:04.680
Rajini, uh-uh. This one.

11:06.800 --> 11:07.600
Hello, sir.

11:07.680 --> 11:09.280
- Hello!
- That's my wife, Kumud.

11:09.440 --> 11:10.560
Delighted!

11:11.960 --> 11:14.480
So, I think I'll just
leave the happy couples

11:14.520 --> 11:15.800
to enjoy their moment.

11:16.080 --> 11:17.400
See you later.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.080
Yes.

11:19.560 --> 11:20.920
He's back from his holiday.

11:22.080 --> 11:24.040
- Hi!
- Hang on, let me go first.

11:24.160 --> 11:24.960
How have you been?

11:24.960 --> 11:26.040
- How are you, Rajini?
- I'm good.

11:26.080 --> 11:28.200
- Very well.
- How are you, my children?

11:28.200 --> 11:29.760
Welcome back!

11:30.600 --> 11:32.800
How could we be
without our mother, sir?

11:33.720 --> 11:34.520
So...

11:34.920 --> 11:36.120
What's new with Titan?

11:36.160 --> 11:39.600
- There's a big... - You've
already started discussing work.

11:39.640 --> 11:41.600
Enjoy the day.

11:42.040 --> 11:43.160
From tomorrow, it's back to work.

11:44.360 --> 11:45.440
All right.

11:48.600 --> 11:51.040
You've started to look
more like Zee day by day.

11:52.800 --> 11:53.800
- Nice.
- Do one thing.

11:54.560 --> 11:56.280
Stop oiling your hair.

11:56.600 --> 11:59.160
You'll surely become
Titan's MD in a few years.

12:00.280 --> 12:01.680
Right.

12:03.680 --> 12:06.480
How is your European
adventure going, Desai?

12:06.520 --> 12:07.320
Good, sir.

12:07.400 --> 12:09.040
Akash, it's been a long time.

12:13.400 --> 12:14.560
"Europe?"

12:15.800 --> 12:18.280
- "Adventure?"
- Yes, we will...

12:19.120 --> 12:22.200
As I said, we'll talk
about it tomorrow

12:23.000 --> 12:24.200
in the office.

12:26.480 --> 12:27.600
Megha?

12:30.800 --> 12:32.560
Megha, I'm talking to you.

12:34.400 --> 12:35.800
Sir...

12:37.240 --> 12:39.480
We've entered the European market.

12:44.240 --> 12:45.680
Did we?

12:46.600 --> 12:47.720
Yes.

12:51.880 --> 12:52.800
Excuse me, please.

12:54.760 --> 12:56.040
How much is the deal worth, Zee?

12:56.560 --> 12:58.200
Just calm down.

12:58.240 --> 13:00.080
- Zee, how much is the deal worth?
- Let's...

13:03.600 --> 13:04.800
500 million.

13:05.000 --> 13:06.320
"500 million!"

13:06.560 --> 13:08.400
Just be quiet.

13:08.440 --> 13:10.280
Even the gross sales in India
are lower than that.

13:10.320 --> 13:12.600
- I know that. - How could you make
such a big decision without me, Zee?

13:12.640 --> 13:14.680
I didn't want to disturb you
during your vacation.

13:14.720 --> 13:16.200
- Just relax.
- Uh, hold on.

13:17.120 --> 13:18.280
Now, I get it.

13:19.320 --> 13:20.920
You sent Megha on her honeymoon

13:20.920 --> 13:22.520
before hiring M.S.D.

13:22.560 --> 13:23.680
Similarly, you sent me on paid leave

13:23.760 --> 13:25.320
because you knew
I'd oppose the idea!

13:25.360 --> 13:26.640
No, that's not what I...

13:26.760 --> 13:28.160
- Stop lying to me, Zee.
- I'm not.

13:28.160 --> 13:31.120
I couldn't let such a lucrative deal
slip through my fingers.

13:31.200 --> 13:33.640
- Just calm down.
- What era are you living in?

13:33.800 --> 13:35.840
Couldn't you call me? Huh?

13:41.280 --> 13:43.080
- Can we go out?
- Please!

13:53.200 --> 13:54.680
You both could have told me.

13:55.000 --> 13:57.920
Sir, we didn't want to disturb you
during your family time.

13:58.160 --> 13:59.360
He asked us not to tell you.

14:03.000 --> 14:03.840
Nice.

14:09.200 --> 14:10.320
Look, Akash.

14:10.840 --> 14:12.560
We'll have more deals. Okay?

14:12.880 --> 14:14.280
I've closed this one,

14:14.360 --> 14:15.360
and you can handle the next.

14:15.400 --> 14:16.880
Will we even be in a position
to make another deal?

14:16.920 --> 14:19.120
- Of course.
- 500 million!

14:19.240 --> 14:21.200
If anything goes wrong,
we'll be finished.

14:21.240 --> 14:23.400
You know, Akash,
this is your main problem.

14:23.760 --> 14:26.560
You just don't understand
that if we hadn't taken a risk,

14:26.600 --> 14:29.440
you'd still be at NBIDC,

14:29.640 --> 14:31.040
and Titan would have
remained a dream.

14:31.080 --> 14:33.920
- Zee... - I would rather take
a risk than live with regret.

14:34.000 --> 14:35.480
Why... Why can't you understand?

14:35.480 --> 14:37.720
There's a right time
to take risks, Zee.

14:38.480 --> 14:40.440
We can't jump
at the first sign of water.

14:41.320 --> 14:43.720
If it turns out to be a mire,
we won't be able to get out.

14:43.760 --> 14:45.320
Even if you see

14:45.440 --> 14:47.440
a pool of opportunities,

14:47.560 --> 14:49.320
you would still see only the mire!

14:49.960 --> 14:53.040
Your mindset
is still stuck in NBIDC.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.680
A secure job with zero risk!

14:55.280 --> 14:56.920
Life doesn't work like that.

15:02.840 --> 15:04.560
"A secure job?" Hmm?

15:05.240 --> 15:06.360
"Zero risk?"

15:06.760 --> 15:08.600
Haven't we ever taken a risk?

15:08.640 --> 15:10.240
I took the risks,

15:11.280 --> 15:13.080
and all you've done is complain.

15:14.120 --> 15:15.280
Man! You...

15:16.240 --> 15:19.560
When did you go from "we" to "I"?

15:23.240 --> 15:25.600
Akash, today it's not about

15:26.000 --> 15:27.880
"I" or "we".

15:27.960 --> 15:29.560
Today is about Jeh.

15:30.000 --> 15:32.120
So grow up. Okay?

15:33.480 --> 15:37.080
Tomorrow, we'll talk in the office.

15:38.640 --> 15:39.880
You've changed, Zee.

15:41.480 --> 15:42.800
You changed

15:43.440 --> 15:45.280
while trying to change the times.

15:45.360 --> 15:46.760
Yes, I've changed.

15:47.320 --> 15:48.960
I have changed, Akash.

15:49.560 --> 15:51.240
One must change with the times.

15:51.640 --> 15:53.120
Why don't you try it?

15:55.560 --> 15:56.560
You know what?

15:57.480 --> 15:59.760
You're just saying all this
to satisfy your ego.

15:59.840 --> 16:00.760
- No.
- Yes!

16:00.840 --> 16:01.680
No!

16:01.960 --> 16:04.640
Earlier, our partnership
was driven by passion,

16:06.280 --> 16:08.120
but now it is driven by money.

16:09.880 --> 16:12.240
You have begun to exclude me
from every decision.

16:12.560 --> 16:14.000
- "Every decision?"
- Yes, every decision!

16:14.080 --> 16:14.880
Just one...

16:14.920 --> 16:17.200
You always exclude me from every
decision. And you know what?

16:19.720 --> 16:21.520
I'm no longer needed here.

16:22.320 --> 16:23.320
Then what?

16:23.520 --> 16:25.000
Will you resign again?

16:29.720 --> 16:30.520
Yes.

16:32.040 --> 16:34.200
At first, it was our company,

16:38.080 --> 16:39.760
but now it's just yours.

16:40.720 --> 16:42.720
And I can't work for your company.

16:45.600 --> 16:47.320
All the best, Mr. Desai.

16:52.440 --> 16:53.360
Let's go.

17:46.640 --> 17:48.320
- Hello.
'- Hello, Xerxes?'

17:48.400 --> 17:49.200
Yes.

17:49.320 --> 17:50.560
'This is Rebecca.'

17:51.480 --> 17:52.280
Hi.

17:52.320 --> 17:54.840
I don't want to bring you bad news,

17:55.200 --> 17:58.200
but the sales strategy
doesn't seem to be working.

18:00.960 --> 18:04.880
Please check Clause A25B.

18:04.960 --> 18:08.160
'Xerxes' decision
to conquer the European market'

18:10.120 --> 18:12.760
'turned out to be
the worst mistake of his life.'

18:31.120 --> 18:32.160
You saw it?

18:36.120 --> 18:37.000
Yes.

18:40.000 --> 18:43.000
You'll have to answer
to the board members.

18:44.360 --> 18:45.240
Yes!

18:51.080 --> 18:51.960
30!

18:53.280 --> 18:56.920
Only 30 watches
have been sold across Europe

18:57.920 --> 18:59.600
in the past five months.

19:00.880 --> 19:02.040
Do you realise

19:02.720 --> 19:05.160
how disastrous these numbers are?

19:07.800 --> 19:08.680
Yes.

19:14.040 --> 19:15.120
Desai,

19:16.000 --> 19:17.080
we've made our decision.

19:17.440 --> 19:18.840
You have only eight months.

19:19.040 --> 19:21.680
If there's no turnaround by then,

19:22.480 --> 19:25.000
it'll be all over
for you and your team.

19:53.360 --> 19:55.360
I never imagined Titan

19:56.680 --> 19:58.960
would reach such great heights.

20:00.680 --> 20:02.080
You played well, Desai.

20:03.160 --> 20:04.480
But I suppose

20:06.400 --> 20:07.400
it's time.

20:55.680 --> 20:56.640
Zee.

21:00.880 --> 21:02.200
Zee, what happened?

21:13.680 --> 21:14.720
It's okay.

21:17.200 --> 21:18.000
It'll be okay.

22:23.440 --> 22:24.280
How are you?

22:25.800 --> 22:26.640
What?

22:27.320 --> 22:28.240
What do you mean, "what"?

22:28.560 --> 22:29.800
Why are you asking that?

22:32.320 --> 22:35.360
I'm a loving husband. I...

22:36.400 --> 22:37.960
I care about your needs.

22:42.240 --> 22:43.280
I think

22:44.000 --> 22:45.600
it's time I became a professor.

22:45.800 --> 22:46.680
What do you think?

22:49.360 --> 22:51.200
Zee, please don't leave

22:51.480 --> 22:53.520
without finishing what you started.

22:56.120 --> 22:58.240
Because if that happens, you'd
feel incomplete with me as well,

22:58.280 --> 22:59.480
and I want all of you.

23:00.520 --> 23:02.440
I can't afford to lose
any part of you at all.

23:10.680 --> 23:12.640
The worst mistake in the world

23:13.240 --> 23:15.280
is not learning from your mistakes.

23:16.680 --> 23:18.400
To learn from your mistake,

23:18.440 --> 23:19.680
you must first admit it.

23:56.840 --> 23:58.320
I should've called you.

23:59.760 --> 24:00.920
I was scared

24:02.000 --> 24:03.760
you'd say no, and...

24:06.880 --> 24:08.200
I didn't want to fight.

24:10.280 --> 24:11.160
Anything else?

24:16.000 --> 24:17.000
I'm sorry.

24:17.080 --> 24:18.360
Who's saying that?

24:18.600 --> 24:20.960
A friend or a boss?

24:21.000 --> 24:22.240
To hell with "boss".

24:28.920 --> 24:30.600
It is your friend calling you back.

24:32.000 --> 24:32.720
- Akash.

24:43.360 --> 24:44.520
Akash,

24:45.360 --> 24:48.240
are you happy at NBIDC?

24:55.520 --> 24:57.880
Yes, Grandfather... Dad.

24:58.920 --> 25:02.080
You stay out all day.

25:03.360 --> 25:06.040
You must take care
of your family as well.

25:06.840 --> 25:07.720
Huh?

25:09.520 --> 25:14.120
Think about Kumud and Vihaan.

25:15.280 --> 25:17.440
Vihaan is still young.

25:19.800 --> 25:23.640
You should watch him
grow before your eyes.

25:24.320 --> 25:26.920
When I was young,

25:27.120 --> 25:29.680
I couldn't spend time with you.

25:32.080 --> 25:33.760
Don't be like me.

25:34.400 --> 25:36.160
- Okay, Dad.
- Yes.

25:38.320 --> 25:40.840
Where's my stick?

25:41.320 --> 25:43.840
Dad, you already have it.

25:44.160 --> 25:45.120
Yes.

25:45.560 --> 25:49.680
You've served me wholeheartedly.

25:50.200 --> 25:52.120
May God bless everyone

25:52.640 --> 25:54.600
with a son like you.

26:01.200 --> 26:03.160
But don't do anything wrong

26:03.520 --> 26:06.200
to your son when I'm gone.

26:08.080 --> 26:11.360
Dad, please come with me.
Let's go to your room.

26:12.000 --> 26:14.840
My blessings are always with you.

26:40.200 --> 26:41.760
I'm sure you have all been wondering

26:41.800 --> 26:43.400
where I've been
over the past few days.

26:46.840 --> 26:48.120
I didn't know how to tell you.

26:51.160 --> 26:52.800
Titan has failed

26:55.520 --> 26:57.080
miserably in Europe.

27:00.960 --> 27:02.360
Catastrophically.

27:04.840 --> 27:06.240
I took the risk

27:09.440 --> 27:11.240
against everyone's advice.

27:13.000 --> 27:14.560
J.R.D.

27:15.480 --> 27:16.680
Gopalan.

27:18.520 --> 27:19.680
Akash.

27:23.720 --> 27:25.120
Everyone

27:25.680 --> 27:28.480
warned me about this decision,

27:29.480 --> 27:32.360
but I listened to no one.

27:34.400 --> 27:36.360
I'm the one to blame.

27:39.720 --> 27:40.960
I'm sorry.

27:44.680 --> 27:47.880
Titan has only eight months left.

27:50.640 --> 27:53.680
After that, our company

27:54.040 --> 27:55.840
might shut down permanently.

28:07.000 --> 28:08.040
I'm sorry.

28:13.120 --> 28:14.080
It's over.

28:28.760 --> 28:29.840
Relax, Zee!

28:30.640 --> 28:32.240
It's not only your fault.

28:35.600 --> 28:38.000
Before starting a business,

28:38.720 --> 28:40.960
you must understand the market.

28:41.720 --> 28:44.760
We understood the Indian market,
but what about the European market?

28:49.560 --> 28:51.240
It doesn't make any sense.

28:52.560 --> 28:55.480
I still think it's possible
to succeed in this market.

28:56.160 --> 28:57.960
It is.

28:59.840 --> 29:01.360
We're not denying it.

29:02.120 --> 29:04.240
But again,
where will the funds come from?

29:07.680 --> 29:09.960
We have invested so much money

29:11.240 --> 29:13.440
and sixteen years in this company.

29:14.240 --> 29:16.080
How can I just let it all slip away?

29:18.720 --> 29:21.240
The hunger for success

29:21.760 --> 29:24.440
is a tricky thing, Zee.

29:25.280 --> 29:27.560
It demands a huge investment,

29:27.760 --> 29:29.800
and there's no guarantee
of a return.

29:31.600 --> 29:34.560
You have to know the soil
before planting the seeds.

29:37.520 --> 29:39.200
I feel

29:39.760 --> 29:42.000
Europe will not accept us.

29:42.040 --> 29:44.840
At least, not for now.

29:47.160 --> 29:48.120
Then I failed.

29:48.160 --> 29:49.880
Uh-uh! Try again.

29:51.120 --> 29:52.360
Fail again.

29:53.800 --> 29:55.280
Fail better.

29:57.040 --> 29:59.320
There's nothing wrong
with failure, Zee.

30:00.280 --> 30:02.720
After all, the MD of Titan

30:02.760 --> 30:05.480
deserves the freedom to fail.

31:24.720 --> 31:25.640
What?

31:26.720 --> 31:27.920
Thank you, Rajini.

31:28.360 --> 31:29.400
For what?

31:30.200 --> 31:31.160
Everything.

31:36.120 --> 31:37.560
Shall we go out for dinner?

31:39.200 --> 31:41.440
I have a deadline,
so I need to finish my work.

31:42.240 --> 31:43.280
I'll cook.

31:44.240 --> 31:45.680
Oh, thank you!

32:47.640 --> 32:49.720
Mr. Desai, can I come in?

32:49.840 --> 32:50.640
Yes.

32:54.280 --> 32:56.000
- If you're busy, I'll come later.
- No! No! No!

32:56.040 --> 32:57.080
Please do come.

32:58.760 --> 33:01.000
Sir, earlier you said
it was all over for us.

33:03.360 --> 33:05.120
I have worked all my life, sir.

33:06.240 --> 33:09.240
I always felt something was missing.

33:09.480 --> 33:11.080
But, since I came here,

33:12.920 --> 33:14.360
I realised

33:14.960 --> 33:17.040
this is what
I wanted to do all along.

33:18.240 --> 33:20.080
Sir, there’s passion
in the air here.

33:21.360 --> 33:23.080
And now I've got used to it.

33:26.280 --> 33:29.000
We have eight months
with us, sir, don't we?

33:29.360 --> 33:30.440
Right.

33:30.800 --> 33:32.560
During these eight months,

33:33.360 --> 33:35.640
I'll be available 24/7

33:35.960 --> 33:38.320
whenever you need me for any work.

33:38.400 --> 33:41.000
Your timing is perfect.

33:42.200 --> 33:43.240
Look at this.

33:44.800 --> 33:48.400
Sir, is this an anaconda
or a shape-shifting snake?

33:48.440 --> 33:49.680
"Snake?"

33:49.800 --> 33:50.920
This is not a snake.

33:51.000 --> 33:52.160
Sir, what do you want to make?

33:52.280 --> 33:54.640
Please tell me. I'll make it.

33:55.600 --> 33:56.400
Okay.

34:01.440 --> 34:03.440
A bit more.

34:03.600 --> 34:04.600
Okay.

34:11.520 --> 34:13.440
- A little more.
- Okay.

34:20.720 --> 34:21.560
What?

34:25.200 --> 34:27.440
Mr. Desai, I'm doing it,

34:28.120 --> 34:29.880
but I don't think it will work.

34:30.560 --> 34:31.640
That's impossible.

34:36.160 --> 34:37.200
Okay!

34:47.760 --> 34:48.560
I'll be back.

34:55.200 --> 34:56.600
This can't work.

35:04.480 --> 35:06.240
I'm not very good at saying sorry.

35:07.880 --> 35:08.880
Which is strange,

35:09.080 --> 35:11.040
considering how often I'm wrong.

35:11.480 --> 35:13.200
I have called you all here

35:13.240 --> 35:17.360
to withdraw the apology
I made the other day.

35:18.400 --> 35:20.400
I'm very sorry.

35:20.800 --> 35:22.520
I gave up too soon.

35:23.720 --> 35:25.960
I was acting as if
it were our last day,

35:26.040 --> 35:27.960
but it wasn't. It isn't!

35:29.640 --> 35:30.960
We 'pack' time

35:31.280 --> 35:33.880
into a tiny box

35:34.680 --> 35:35.880
and sell it to people.

35:35.960 --> 35:37.600
We deliver it into their hands,

35:37.920 --> 35:40.480
and start feeling
as if time is in our hands.

35:40.600 --> 35:41.800
"We have it."

35:42.360 --> 35:43.520
"We own it."

35:44.520 --> 35:45.840
But it's not true.

35:47.480 --> 35:49.560
Time plays its own game.

35:50.240 --> 35:51.720
All we have...

35:57.760 --> 35:58.800
Is this!

36:01.240 --> 36:02.120
Us.

36:05.280 --> 36:07.560
So, let's use what we have.

36:09.520 --> 36:11.440
We have eight months!

36:11.840 --> 36:13.160
Eight months!

36:13.400 --> 36:14.720
We have time!

36:15.200 --> 36:17.000
Eight months may feel short,

36:17.560 --> 36:19.320
but if we work together

36:19.520 --> 36:21.440
and trust one another,

36:22.160 --> 36:23.160
perhaps

36:23.880 --> 36:27.000
we'll make history
and set a precedent.

36:27.360 --> 36:28.520
Let's create something

36:28.560 --> 36:31.000
that history will remember us by,

36:31.320 --> 36:32.800
even when we're gone!

36:33.880 --> 36:36.600
Let's make something unforgettable!

36:37.920 --> 36:38.960
What do you say?

36:39.040 --> 36:40.400
Yes, sir.

36:40.560 --> 36:41.560
Yes, sir.

36:47.080 --> 36:48.160
Timing!

36:51.360 --> 36:52.200
Sir.

36:54.640 --> 36:55.440
Hmm?

37:00.320 --> 37:01.160
Sir.

37:01.960 --> 37:04.480
Some fine-tuning is still needed,
but I'll do it.

37:04.680 --> 37:06.240
It's beautiful.

37:09.240 --> 37:11.080
- Sir, this is...
- Incredible!

37:11.680 --> 37:12.640
I know.

37:13.320 --> 37:14.240
"Incredible?"

37:14.720 --> 37:15.840
This is impossible.

37:16.480 --> 37:18.160
But that's what is exciting, sir.

37:19.720 --> 37:21.600
No one in the whole world
has ever attempted this.

37:21.680 --> 37:23.840
They didn't attempt it
for a good reason.

37:23.960 --> 37:26.800
Yes, sir, but if we make this,

37:27.080 --> 37:28.760
it will be revolutionary.

37:29.560 --> 37:31.720
And we already have
the freedom to fail.

37:32.080 --> 37:33.240
Absolutely.

37:34.760 --> 37:35.800
[in Tamil] Okay, sir.

37:37.360 --> 37:38.200
[in Tamil] Okay.

37:41.000 --> 37:41.880
[in Tamil] Okay?

37:46.520 --> 37:47.480
[in Tamil] Okay, sir?

37:52.320 --> 37:53.160
[in Tamil] Okay.

38:08.200 --> 38:10.680
We'll definitely need
new batteries for this.

38:11.640 --> 38:12.720
We'll also need to adjust the dial.

38:12.800 --> 38:14.720
The step motor
and the electronic circuit too.

38:15.440 --> 38:16.960
The case will need changing as well.

38:17.120 --> 38:19.080
Basically, we'll need
to replace everything.

38:19.840 --> 38:21.680
- This is the cannon pinion...
- Mr. Desai.

38:21.720 --> 38:23.560
- Turning and...
- Sir!

38:23.640 --> 38:24.760
- One second. I'll be back.
- Fine.

38:24.800 --> 38:25.920
- Just give me five minutes.
- Okay.

38:27.120 --> 38:29.760
Sir, we'll need to make the
components, not just the watch.

38:29.920 --> 38:30.720
Why?

38:30.800 --> 38:33.480
Because no one in the entire world
manufactures such components.

38:33.760 --> 38:35.360
- Really?
- Yes, sir.

38:38.080 --> 38:39.400
Okay. What do we need?

38:39.760 --> 38:40.920
Sir, we need...

38:49.040 --> 38:51.120
Its case should be made of steel.

38:51.200 --> 38:52.680
Sir, if we use a steel case,

38:52.760 --> 38:55.520
we'll have to redesign the circuit,
the motor and the battery.

38:55.960 --> 38:58.760
And in that case, it will be nearly
impossible to make it waterproof.

38:59.720 --> 39:01.040
We'll have to figure something out.

39:05.440 --> 39:07.160
The case won't be able
to bear the weight.

39:12.080 --> 39:13.400
Let's use carbon fibre.

39:17.640 --> 39:19.520
Carbon fibre is a good idea, sir.

39:48.480 --> 39:49.520
Mr. Desai.

39:55.920 --> 39:57.320
What is its water resistance?

39:57.920 --> 39:59.040
Two ATM, sir.

40:01.080 --> 40:03.720
The global standard
is three ATM, A.J.K.

40:04.000 --> 40:06.400
Sir, the carbon fibre
won't let the back covers fit.

40:06.920 --> 40:08.200
Then either redesign it

40:08.560 --> 40:09.880
or use a different material.

40:10.440 --> 40:11.360
Just find a solution.

40:25.440 --> 40:26.680
You've outdone yourself.

40:28.640 --> 40:31.760
This tagline will be the cornerstone
of our marketing strategy.

40:33.680 --> 40:34.800
Well done, Megha.

40:39.080 --> 40:40.080
Thank you, sir.

40:40.280 --> 40:41.440
You're the brightest Titan.

41:20.560 --> 41:21.400
Sir...

41:29.480 --> 41:30.360
Is that...

41:47.400 --> 41:48.360
And it's...

41:49.480 --> 41:50.400
Yes.

41:50.800 --> 41:52.280
All tests have been successful.

42:10.480 --> 42:11.760
I asked for the moon,

42:13.080 --> 42:14.400
and my team delivered.

42:20.120 --> 42:21.920
Sir, whether or not
history remembers us,

42:25.200 --> 42:26.800
we'll never forget
these eight months.

42:41.360 --> 42:43.840
Congratulations to all of us!

42:43.920 --> 42:44.960
- Yes!
- Yes!

42:45.920 --> 42:47.680
Best team... Best team in the world.

42:53.640 --> 42:55.320
I was just about to leave, Zee.

42:55.400 --> 42:56.920
You've come at the right time.

42:58.160 --> 43:01.480
- Where are you going?
- To Paris, on holiday.

43:01.560 --> 43:02.800
Oh! At 89?

43:05.280 --> 43:06.600
I'm going to meet Thelma.

43:07.800 --> 43:08.760
We need

43:10.200 --> 43:12.720
some more time to...

43:13.960 --> 43:16.640
We need to spend
some more time together.

43:18.480 --> 43:19.800
[in Gujarati] What
are you doing here?

43:20.560 --> 43:22.960
[in Gujarati] All the board members
were asking about you.

43:25.760 --> 43:27.080
[in Gujarati] I have a gift for you.

43:27.880 --> 43:28.680
Huh?

43:29.200 --> 43:30.080
Thank you!

43:41.520 --> 43:43.160
I see! Is this real?

43:43.560 --> 43:44.440
It is.

43:44.880 --> 43:47.840
And don't worry,
as we ran all the tests.

43:48.520 --> 43:49.440
Ooh!

43:51.360 --> 43:53.000
It's a...

43:54.720 --> 43:55.520
A milestone?

43:55.560 --> 43:57.200
Yes, it's a milestone.

43:57.240 --> 43:58.600
- Right?
- Yes!

43:59.280 --> 44:00.480
Tomorrow...

44:01.280 --> 44:03.480
Titan's future will be decided

44:03.600 --> 44:05.320
at tomorrow's board meeting.

44:05.840 --> 44:09.000
So, either you'll reach
your destination or...

44:11.480 --> 44:12.960
I'm proud of you, Zee.

44:16.160 --> 44:17.600
You and your team

44:17.680 --> 44:20.240
didn't just create
this company's identity.

44:20.680 --> 44:22.800
You've created a community.

44:23.120 --> 44:24.680
What you have made is...

44:25.840 --> 44:26.840
This

44:27.440 --> 44:29.480
will bring happiness
not only to those who make it,

44:30.400 --> 44:33.400
but also to those
who sell and buy it.

44:35.960 --> 44:40.400
You know, India must not become
only an economic superpower.

44:40.480 --> 44:42.280
It should be a happy country.

44:43.480 --> 44:47.800
And you've helped me
make India a little happier.

45:09.760 --> 45:10.800
Mr. Tata!

45:13.040 --> 45:13.840
Small world!

45:14.760 --> 45:17.200
- [in French] Mr. Jeuba, how are you?
- Very good.

45:17.480 --> 45:18.760
- May I?
- Please!

45:18.840 --> 45:20.400
- Please!
- [in French] Thank you!

45:21.760 --> 45:23.960
- I heard about Titan.
- Ah!

45:24.040 --> 45:25.200
Good for India.

45:25.520 --> 45:27.960
And it seems the world

45:28.160 --> 45:30.440
is also ready for Titan.

45:32.600 --> 45:34.720
You are a piece of work, Mr. Tata.

45:35.760 --> 45:38.400
So are our watches.

45:42.640 --> 45:45.320
You must be happy

45:45.440 --> 45:48.000
that our watches
didn't work in Europe.

45:50.440 --> 45:52.720
Well, not really.

45:52.840 --> 45:54.040
"Not really?" Why?

45:55.600 --> 45:56.720
I have a confession.

45:56.920 --> 45:57.720
What?

46:00.440 --> 46:02.000
Fine, here it is.

46:02.600 --> 46:05.280
You guys didn't fail in Europe.

46:05.880 --> 46:07.680
What do you mean?

46:08.600 --> 46:10.400
In the early '70s,

46:10.760 --> 46:14.000
Japanese watch brands entered Europe

46:14.200 --> 46:16.280
and disrupted our watch industry

46:16.640 --> 46:19.640
with their low prices
and high quality.

46:20.520 --> 46:22.080
So we decided not to allow

46:22.200 --> 46:24.920
any other country to launch
their watches in Europe.

46:26.320 --> 46:28.640
And then Titan happened.

46:29.280 --> 46:32.400
Again, low price and high quality.

46:33.400 --> 46:35.280
All the European watch companies

46:35.520 --> 46:37.720
came together to push you out.

46:38.200 --> 46:39.280
Even Rebecca.

46:39.800 --> 46:41.560
It was a monopoly.

46:43.600 --> 46:45.040
A strategised one.

46:45.520 --> 46:47.320
Not much of a surprise.

46:49.680 --> 46:51.640
Titan didn't lose.

46:52.000 --> 46:53.280
It was defeated.

47:00.160 --> 47:01.840
All my time in this business,

47:02.960 --> 47:04.520
and all the people I've met,

47:06.600 --> 47:08.120
have taught me one thing.

47:09.240 --> 47:11.920
Nothing is predictable.

47:13.480 --> 47:14.480
Not life,

47:15.920 --> 47:17.120
not family,

47:18.560 --> 47:20.440
and certainly not the market.

47:22.160 --> 47:23.920
We keep predicting,

47:24.800 --> 47:27.680
and life keeps giving us surprises.

47:28.760 --> 47:31.640
Plans, strategies,

47:31.920 --> 47:33.160
or targets.

47:34.160 --> 47:37.960
The people of this company
matter more than any of them.

47:39.440 --> 47:41.520
Because they give us their blood,

47:42.280 --> 47:44.760
their sweat, their tears,

47:45.640 --> 47:47.200
and their time.

47:48.040 --> 47:50.760
- May I help you?
- No, thank you.

47:50.840 --> 47:52.320
- All right.
- It's all right.

47:52.360 --> 47:53.960
It was nice meeting you, Mr. Tata.

47:54.040 --> 47:55.520
- Same here.
- Hope to see you soon.

47:55.720 --> 47:59.800
You know, no matter what
the market throws at us,

48:00.080 --> 48:02.200
we will always come back.

48:08.360 --> 48:11.200
Our team has pushed our design

48:11.360 --> 48:14.640
and engineering capabilities
to their limits.

48:15.160 --> 48:16.720
We would like to present to you

48:16.800 --> 48:20.880
a watch with a mechanism
thinner than a five-rupee coin,

48:22.880 --> 48:27.120
weighing just 22 grams.

48:32.720 --> 48:36.960
Presenting the slimmest watch
in the universe.

48:37.560 --> 48:38.880
Titan Edge!

49:15.400 --> 49:17.120
Congratulations!

49:17.320 --> 49:19.120
Congratulations!

49:32.080 --> 49:35.280
'This is how a dream
became a reality'

49:35.360 --> 49:37.640
'and adorned the wrists
of people across our country.'

49:39.440 --> 49:43.560
'The Titan brand became
a symbol of a changing India.'

49:49.520 --> 49:50.640
Good evening!

49:54.920 --> 49:56.560
Welcome, Mr. Desai.

49:57.520 --> 49:58.520
Mr. Jeuba.

49:58.960 --> 50:01.480
Congratulations on Titan's success.

50:01.560 --> 50:02.480
Thank you.

50:02.880 --> 50:04.360
It's nice to finally meet you.

50:05.400 --> 50:08.160
So, we are finally collaborating.

50:08.400 --> 50:10.800
I think there's
some misunderstanding

50:10.840 --> 50:12.280
about the purpose of my visit.

50:35.680 --> 50:37.920
'I forgot to give you
some personal information.'

50:38.680 --> 50:42.200
'Do you remember when Akash said
I'd be Titan's MD one day?'

50:43.160 --> 50:44.800
'I became an MD after a few years,'

50:45.520 --> 50:46.960
'but I didn't go bald.'
